WEBVTT

00:14.540 --> 00:17.280
So weak...

00:34.630 --> 00:40.650
Welcome to my bedchamber.

00:51.320 --> 00:56.870
The Faraway Paladin

00:53.160 --> 00:56.870
<b><u>The Lord of the Rust Mountains</u></b>

02:14.110 --> 02:20.490
The Lord of the Rust Mountains

02:26.060 --> 02:27.940
Weak one...

02:28.930 --> 02:31.870
One destined to die...

02:32.860 --> 02:36.170
I ask your name.

02:40.840 --> 02:42.620
What is the matter?

02:43.640 --> 02:45.770
Will you not give your name?

02:47.880 --> 02:49.890
Can you not even speak?

02:52.010 --> 02:53.160
<i>This is...</i>

02:53.970 --> 02:56.230
<i>an overwhelming predator...</i>

03:13.630 --> 03:16.300
You may try to deny feelings 
like fear and anxiety,

03:16.300 --> 03:18.230
but it won't make them go away.

03:18.810 --> 03:23.180
What you need in order to 
be confident is not pride,

03:23.520 --> 03:28.550
and what you need in order to be 
courageous is not false bravado.

03:32.260 --> 03:36.320
Everything begins with acceptance.

03:50.880 --> 03:52.820
If you're going to ask someone's name,

03:52.820 --> 03:55.330
should you not give your own first?

03:55.860 --> 03:57.090
Ah...

03:58.150 --> 03:59.850
It would seem that

04:00.290 --> 04:05.780
you are not one of the lowly rabble 
who merely seek to plunder.

04:07.590 --> 04:09.580
Then I shall give you my name.

04:10.570 --> 04:15.010
I am the sickle of the gods: 
Calamity's Sickle.

04:15.490 --> 04:18.850
I was born with the last flicker of a star,

04:18.850 --> 04:22.050
and my life is eternal.

04:22.050 --> 04:24.800
I am the lord of miasma and sulfur,

04:24.800 --> 04:26.860
and brother of the lava...

04:28.560 --> 04:30.620
Valacirca.

04:34.660 --> 04:39.920
Now, answer me, small one.

04:43.490 --> 04:45.930
My grandfather was the Wandering Sage.

04:45.930 --> 04:50.030
One of my parents, my father, 
was the War Ogre of the star of Leo,

04:50.030 --> 04:52.220
and my mother was the beloved 
daughter of Mater.

04:53.220 --> 04:55.460
I am known as the Light of the Hinterlands,

04:55.460 --> 04:56.940
the Faraway Paladin,

04:57.670 --> 05:00.210
disciple of Gracefeel, the goddess of flux:

05:00.210 --> 05:02.520
William G. Maryblood.

05:02.820 --> 05:06.520
It is an honor to make your acquaintance, 
dragon of the age of gods.

05:13.630 --> 05:16.210
What serendipity!

05:16.820 --> 05:18.790
Those names fill me with nostalgia.

05:19.260 --> 05:20.760
Nostalgia?

05:20.980 --> 05:26.340
Had they called on me 
before the demons did,

05:26.340 --> 05:31.940
perhaps we may have fought side by side.

05:34.330 --> 05:37.900
I detect a faint hint of the god 
of the undead's scent on you,

05:37.900 --> 05:41.510
and you proclaim yourself a disciple 
of the goddess of light.

05:41.770 --> 05:43.340
I see.

05:43.340 --> 05:47.520
That explains the age disparity.

05:48.240 --> 05:53.280
Now, I believe that concludes our 
introductions and inquiries.

05:53.280 --> 05:54.460
Yes.

06:09.840 --> 06:12.040
Faraway Paladin...

06:13.430 --> 06:16.760
Do you wish to take me as your servant?

06:18.090 --> 06:20.680
Why does that surprise you so?

06:21.100 --> 06:24.690
You and your companions 
destroyed the demons.

06:25.050 --> 06:29.690
You are a danger even to me, 
and that is inconvenient.

06:29.970 --> 06:35.810
So it is only natural that I would 
seek something new to depend upon.

06:37.510 --> 06:40.900
I do have my ulterior motives, of course.

06:42.240 --> 06:45.340
I will seek appropriate compensation.

06:50.790 --> 06:52.550
Have no fear.

06:53.410 --> 06:57.350
I do not wish to fight a brave 
warrior such as yourself.

06:57.350 --> 06:59.350
Yet in a few decades,

06:59.350 --> 07:04.360
you'll kill me, destroy everything, 
and change loyalties again.

07:04.820 --> 07:06.980
That's how you operate.

07:19.090 --> 07:23.340
Splendid! Splendid! You are correct!

07:31.500 --> 07:36.020
But it is not such a bad deal, is it?

07:39.520 --> 07:40.750
<i>He's right.</i>

07:41.210 --> 07:45.520
<i>If I accept, I won't have to 
fight a losing battle now.</i>

07:45.890 --> 07:50.010
What reason do you have to fight me?

07:50.620 --> 07:54.540
It is because you perceive me 
as a threat to innocent people

07:54.540 --> 07:58.170
that you came to me armed with spear 
and determination, is it not?

08:09.590 --> 08:13.310
Look. Now I am no threat.

08:13.310 --> 08:15.720
I lower my head to you.

08:21.450 --> 08:24.090
<i>What... is this?</i>

08:24.480 --> 08:27.300
Now, make your choice,

08:27.300 --> 08:31.470
Faraway Paladin, hero of the modern age!

08:31.950 --> 08:35.550
Show me that you have what 
it takes to control me!

08:36.640 --> 08:41.030
Will you choose peace, 
or a battle resulting in your demise?

08:41.540 --> 08:44.560
I am not a patient creature.

08:45.160 --> 08:47.250
Choose quickly.

08:55.320 --> 08:56.640
<i>What is this?</i>

08:57.000 --> 08:59.190
<i>Should I refuse?</i>

09:00.110 --> 09:02.640
<i>No, if I do that...</i>

09:03.040 --> 09:04.440
<i>What should I do?</i>

09:06.120 --> 09:07.990
<i>What choice should I make?</i>

09:27.060 --> 09:28.190
<i>Someone...</i>

09:49.210 --> 09:50.380
<i>That's right.</i>

09:51.070 --> 09:54.770
<i>I've already been saved... by her.</i>

09:55.540 --> 09:58.810
<i>If courage is something that 
can take a physical form,</i>

09:59.490 --> 10:01.340
<i>then in my heart now is...</i>

10:02.200 --> 10:04.530
Menel, Reystov,

10:05.010 --> 10:07.280
Al, Ghelreis...

10:08.120 --> 10:11.350
The outcome of this conversation 
will decide everything.

10:12.090 --> 10:13.070
Be ready!

10:18.910 --> 10:20.290
Well?

10:20.730 --> 10:22.310
Have you decided?

10:22.970 --> 10:26.920
Then choose, Faraway Paladin.

10:27.470 --> 10:30.010
Will it be peace or death?

10:30.010 --> 10:31.320
I will not choose.

10:31.670 --> 10:34.560
It is you who must choose, Valacirca.

10:36.030 --> 10:37.560
Oh?

10:38.030 --> 10:41.010
And what choice am I to make?

10:41.010 --> 10:43.570
Will you mend your ways or not?

10:50.410 --> 10:51.880
Let's confirm one thing.

10:52.700 --> 10:55.090
The peace you speak of

10:55.090 --> 10:58.150
is a limited peace between you and me.

10:58.590 --> 11:00.920
It is not specifically peace for me,

11:00.920 --> 11:03.220
or for the innocent people.

11:03.460 --> 11:04.760
Am I wrong?

11:08.960 --> 11:11.730
Indeed, you are correct!

11:12.020 --> 11:15.390
In which case, I have only one condition:

11:16.000 --> 11:17.250
mend your ways!

11:19.970 --> 11:22.760
What am I to improve?

11:22.760 --> 11:27.790
Your extreme enthusiasm for constantly 
scheming and seeking conflict.

11:27.790 --> 11:33.080
If you swear to mend your ways 
and truly seek my patronage,

11:33.080 --> 11:36.500
I will also swear to the goddess 
of light that I will protect you.

11:37.030 --> 11:41.560
For as long as I live, I will defend 
you from all who are hostile to you.

11:41.920 --> 11:43.890
That is how <i>I</i> operate.

11:45.080 --> 11:46.050
Well?

11:46.380 --> 11:49.670
Will you choose to improve, or to fight?

11:49.670 --> 11:52.380
I would like your answer, dragon!

12:11.870 --> 12:13.210
Well done!

12:13.700 --> 12:19.330
You have successfully answered the 
dragon's riddle, Faraway Paladin!

12:20.630 --> 12:25.750
You are no reckless boy flourishing 
his own strength for a lark,

12:25.750 --> 12:29.090
nor are you cunning for the sake 
of protecting your own life.

12:29.580 --> 12:35.500
You walk the path you consider to be 
righteous with valor and wisdom.

12:35.500 --> 12:37.190
Marvelous!

12:38.350 --> 12:42.450
You are in every way the successor 
to those heroes of old!

12:42.450 --> 12:45.810
I acknowledge you as a true hero!

12:53.780 --> 12:58.920
However, I refuse to make the 
choice to change my ways!

13:10.810 --> 13:13.120
I am Valacirca!

13:15.180 --> 13:18.640
I am the sickle of the gods: 
Calamity's Sickle.

13:18.640 --> 13:21.170
I am the lord of miasma and sulfur,

13:21.170 --> 13:23.380
and brother of the lava.

13:23.380 --> 13:27.260
I live only because miasma 
poisons and kills,

13:27.260 --> 13:29.410
and because lava boils hot!

13:29.410 --> 13:33.630
War, disasters, feats of valor, treasure,

13:33.630 --> 13:37.290
death, sacrificial maidens, and heroes:

13:37.290 --> 13:40.200
what is a dragon without any of these?!

13:41.490 --> 13:43.870
I am Valacirca!

13:44.210 --> 13:48.640
The oldest and most powerful of dragons, 
feared even by the gods:

13:48.640 --> 13:50.830
Valacirca!

14:07.150 --> 14:08.720
Hero,

14:09.390 --> 14:12.910
and warriors led by the hero...

14:12.910 --> 14:15.290
I could kill all of you here

14:15.290 --> 14:20.200
and add another new page 
to my terrifying history,

14:20.770 --> 14:26.980
or I could be slain by you and be sung of 
as a feat of valor until the end of time.

14:30.520 --> 14:34.750
Now, if you are prepared for the dragon's 
flames to burn your body and soul to naught

14:34.750 --> 14:38.040
and erase you from the cycle 
of death and rebirth,

14:38.040 --> 14:42.160
then I permit you to challenge me!

14:44.170 --> 14:48.180
<i>This is the great dragon 
of the age of the gods...</i>

14:49.040 --> 14:51.710
<i>He's definitely an opponent I can respect.</i>

14:53.610 --> 14:58.210
The Faraway Paladin, 
William G. Maryblood, is coming for you!

15:03.040 --> 15:04.380
Acceleratio!

15:03.090 --> 15:04.090
<b>Accelerate</b>

15:13.310 --> 15:14.330
Lamina!

15:13.430 --> 15:14.180
<b>Blade</b>

15:19.760 --> 15:21.270
<i>Dragon scales...</i>

15:23.420 --> 15:27.880
<i>If you do intend to fight him, 
you'll want to aim for his old wounds.</i>

15:27.880 --> 15:30.190
<i>Dragon scales are tough.</i>

15:30.190 --> 15:34.730
<i>I doubt even Blood could cut 
through them to his flesh.</i>

15:37.240 --> 15:40.570
<i>I can't keep chasing after Blood forever!</i>

15:47.040 --> 15:48.510
Acceleratio!

15:47.170 --> 15:48.300
<b>Accelerate</b>

15:59.120 --> 16:01.450
You can break through the protection 
of a dragon's scales, eh?

16:01.980 --> 16:06.450
What perfect light exercise 
to keep me awake!

16:08.910 --> 16:09.730
Hey!

16:11.900 --> 16:14.160
Will's not the only one you're fighting!

16:42.070 --> 16:44.040
I see.

16:44.040 --> 16:47.130
Impressive teamwork!

16:54.150 --> 16:55.530
<b>Burn, Flames</b>

16:54.190 --> 16:55.560
Flammo Ignis!

16:58.620 --> 17:01.820
Sylphs, sylphs, maidens of wind!

17:27.070 --> 17:28.330
Now!

17:28.310 --> 17:30.820
<b>Be Tied, Knot, Binding</b>

17:28.330 --> 17:31.000
Ligatur, Nodus, Obligatio!

17:34.060 --> 17:36.310
Conciliat, Sequitur!

17:34.190 --> 17:36.070
<b>Unite, Follow</b>

17:42.540 --> 17:44.340
Vastare!

17:42.660 --> 17:44.040
<b>Devastate</b>

17:48.190 --> 17:50.850
A triple cast! Gus's specialty!

17:51.170 --> 17:54.750
The trump card of trump cards that 
I burned into my eyes that day!

17:55.340 --> 17:58.750
Pallida Mors Aequo Pulsat Pede...

17:55.380 --> 17:58.510
<b>Pale Death Kicks Equally</b>

18:01.270 --> 18:04.180
You would use that in a real battle?!

18:03.500 --> 18:07.770
Pauperum Tabernas Regumque Turres:

18:03.520 --> 18:07.770
<b>Both Huts of Paupers and Towers of Kings</b>

18:10.270 --> 18:12.540
Damnatio Memoriae!

18:10.400 --> 18:12.150
<b>Damnation of Memory</b>

19:07.200 --> 19:08.530
Did we win?

19:09.240 --> 19:10.210
Looks like it.

19:10.210 --> 19:14.670
The moment of victory is 
surprisingly... unsatisfying.

19:21.310 --> 19:22.240
Will?

19:28.390 --> 19:30.420
<i>The dragon is destroyed...</i>

19:31.830 --> 19:33.110
<i>isn't it?</i>

19:34.020 --> 19:36.230
<i>Yet I don't feel certain of our victory.</i>

19:37.520 --> 19:40.500
<i>Not everything is resolved 
by a battle to the death.</i>

19:40.870 --> 19:43.460
<i>Sometimes, you win by pure chance.</i>

19:44.090 --> 19:45.610
<i>And yet...</i>

19:51.980 --> 19:54.060
Is that... wind?

19:56.330 --> 19:57.920
No! It's not over!

20:31.750 --> 20:33.840
He... transformed?

20:36.060 --> 20:37.860
Precisely!

20:47.600 --> 20:49.290
<i>Words of Transformation...</i>

20:50.070 --> 20:53.990
<i>Words so risky that humans 
can't use them...</i>

20:54.540 --> 20:55.890
<i>But that's a good point.</i>

20:56.320 --> 21:01.750
<i>How was a huge beast like Valacirca able 
to get to this underground country?</i>

21:02.950 --> 21:04.560
Have you caught on?

21:05.090 --> 21:06.350
That's right.

21:11.850 --> 21:15.330
The Words are all too well-known to us!

21:17.200 --> 21:18.910
I see.

21:18.910 --> 21:24.250
With the Words of Obliteration, 
you could erase even me...

21:24.610 --> 21:29.000
if your aim was true, that is.

21:34.370 --> 21:38.460
<i>He even knows how to counter 
the ultimate destructive magic.</i>

21:39.250 --> 21:43.150
<i>No, the result would likely be the same, 
no matter what magic I chose.</i>

21:44.180 --> 21:49.500
<i>This dragon has fought every kind of 
Word on every kind of battlefield,</i>

21:49.500 --> 21:50.990
<i>and defeated them all.</i>

21:52.250 --> 21:53.390
This...

21:54.220 --> 21:56.560
This is... a dragon.

23:35.640 --> 23:40.010
The Evil Dragon and the Goddess
